flowchart LR
    classDef event fill:#ff9800,stroke:#e65100,color:#000
    classDef command fill:#2196f3,stroke:#0d47a1,color:#fff
    classDef actor fill:#ffeb3b,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000
    classDef system fill:#9c27b0,stroke:#4a148c,color:#fff
    classDef aggregate fill:#4caf50,stroke:#1b5e20,color:#fff
    classDef hotspot fill:#f44336,stroke:#b71c1c,color:#fff

    Student[学生]:::actor
    Scheduler[系统调度器]:::actor
    CheckinTask[自动签到任务]:::actor
    Huitu[慧图图书馆平台]:::system
    SSO[杭电 SSO]:::system
    Wechat[微信 Webhook]:::system
    GitHub[GitHub Releases]:::system

    Student -->|配置方案| CmdCreatePlan[创建预约方案]:::command
    CmdCreatePlan --> EvtPlanCreated[预约方案已创建]:::event
    EvtPlanCreated --> AggPlan[BookingPlan]:::aggregate

    Student -->|保存星期规则| CmdSavePolicy[保存调度策略]:::command
    CmdSavePolicy --> EvtPolicySaved[调度策略已保存]:::event
    EvtPolicySaved --> AggPolicy[SchedulePolicy]:::aggregate

    Scheduler -->|每天 20:00| CmdRunDaemon[执行后台抢座]:::command
    CmdRunDaemon --> EvtSchedulerFired[系统任务已触发]:::event
    EvtSchedulerFired --> CmdPrewarm[预温 UID/楼层/座位]:::command
    CmdPrewarm --> EvtPrewarmed[抢座参数已预温]:::event

    CmdPrewarm --> Huitu
    Huitu -->|房间/座位| EvtSeatsReady[座位布局已就绪]:::event

    CmdBook[提交 bookSeats]:::command
    EvtSeatsReady --> CmdBook
    CmdBook --> Huitu
    Huitu -->|成功或失败| EvtBookResult[预约响应已返回]:::event
    EvtBookResult --> CmdVerify[列表复核]:::command
    CmdVerify --> EvtBookingVerified[预约已复核]:::event
    EvtBookingVerified --> AggBooking[BookingOrder]:::aggregate
    EvtBookingVerified --> Wechat

    CheckinTask -->|窗口内| CmdCheckIn[执行签到]:::command
    CmdCheckIn --> Huitu
    Huitu -->|状态变更| EvtCheckedIn[预约已签到]:::event
    EvtCheckedIn --> AggBooking

    Student -->|取消/暂离/续座/签退| CmdBookingAction[预约操作]:::command
    CmdBookingAction --> Huitu
    Huitu -->|状态变更| EvtBookingChanged[预约状态已变更]:::event
    EvtBookingChanged --> AggBooking

    Student -->|检查更新| CmdCheckUpdate[检查应用更新]:::command
    CmdCheckUpdate --> GitHub
    GitHub -->|Release| EvtUpdateFound[发现新版本]:::event

    Hot1[? 座位 state 含义未完全确认]:::hotspot
    Hot2[? 限流响应未退避]:::hotspot
    Hot3[? Web 单租户]:::hotspot
